  "description": "Who is the tallest animal? Who is the biggest? Who has the loudest roar? Pick your answer, then meet four animal champions with Milo the bluebird: the giraffe can peek into an upstairs window, the elephant is as heavy as four cars, the tiger is the giant cousin of a pet cat, and a lion's roar can be heard from five miles away.\nAn interactive animal lesson for kids ages 2-6, with questions to answer, counting, actions to copy and a quiz at the end.\n\nThe Animated Zoo makes gentle, colorful videos for little learners. New videos every day! Made with care for ages 2-6. Characters and visuals are animated with the help of AI tools and reviewed for kid safety before publishing.",
